</div><!--/$--></div></div></div></div></header><main id="PAGES_CONTAINER" class="PAGES_CONTAINER" tabindex="-1" data-main-content="true"><div id="SITE_PAGES" class="JsJXaX SITE_PAGES"><div id="SITE_PAGES_TRANSITION_GROUP" class="AnQkDU"><div id="cj5a" class="sMghaC r4zfqq theme-vars cj5a"><div class="kAZTpn wixui-page" data-testid="page-bg"></div><div class="FtiNVl"><!--$--><div id="Containercj5a" class="Containercj5a SPY_vo"><div data-mesh-id="Containercj5ainlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="Containercj5ainlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><section id="comp-ln8wnv0j" tabindex="-1" class="Oqnisf comp-ln8wnv0j wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-ln8wnv0j" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-ln8wnv0j" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-ln8wnv0j" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-ln8wnv0j" class="VgO9Yg"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-ln8wnv0jinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-ln8wnv0jinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="i8tdgpu8" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx i8tdgpu8 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.1em; font-size:40px;"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:basic,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Articles and Info Sheets</span></span></span></h2>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:1.3em; font-size:14px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.3em;"><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Most of these articles were written by <span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="mailto:sschoen@umd.edu" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Susan Schoenian</span></a></span></span>. They are organized according to general subject matter. All articles, including pictures, may be reprinted for educational purposes with permission from the author.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-ln8wnv0k" tabindex="-1" class="Oqnisf comp-ln8wnv0k wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-ln8wnv0k" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-ln8wnv0k" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-ln8wnv0k" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-ln8wnv0k" class="VgO9Yg"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-ln8wnv0kinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-ln8wnv0kinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="i994k9zi" class="JNU2qa i994k9zi"><div class="vEJ4Cu"></div><div class="g7UZOI"></div><div class="NI2qP2 wixui-box"></div><div data-mesh-id="i994k9ziinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="i994k9ziinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="iao7onuc" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx iao7onuc wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h4 class="font_4 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:24px; line-height:1.3em;"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:24px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Latest article:&nbsp; Tariffs:&nbsp; Good or Bad?</span></span></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
&nbsp;</h4></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="i994dla6" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx i994dla6 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">[May 2025] -- Tariffs are not only a polarizing topic, but they are extremely complex. In early April, a 10 percent tariff was imposed on lamb imports from Australia and New Zealand. In 2024, imports reached a record high, accounting for 73 percent of total lamb (and mutton) consumption in the US, with 74 percent coming from Australia and 25 percent from New Zealand.</span></p>

<h4 class="font_4 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px; line-height:1.3em;"><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/tariffs" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Read full article</span></span></span></span></a></h4></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lnxb22ch" class="v__F4U comp-lnxb22ch wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="MVY5Lo"><img fetchpriority="high" sizes="314px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/aded98_497390157dce456781db2995894d8a13~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_314,h_208,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/tariffs.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/aded98_497390157dce456781db2995894d8a13~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_628,h_416,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/tariffs.png 2x" id="img_comp-lnxb22ch" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/aded98_497390157dce456781db2995894d8a13~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_314,h_208,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/tariffs.png" alt="tariffs.png" style="object-fit:cover" class="NM_OGj Tj01hh" width="314" height="208"/></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-ln8wnv0l" tabindex="-1" class="Oqnisf comp-ln8wnv0l wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-ln8wnv0l" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-ln8wnv0l" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-ln8wnv0l" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-ln8wnv0l" class="VgO9Yg"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-ln8wnv0linlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-ln8wnv0linlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="i8tfxyle" class="MMl86N zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx i8tfxyle wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h6 class="font_6 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:24px; line-height:1.3em;"><span style="font-size:24px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:basic,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Breeding and genetics</span></span></span></span></h6>
</div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="i8tfyngc" class="MMl86N zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx i8tfyngc wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.3em;" class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/crossbreeding" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Crossbreeding for profit</span></a></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/evalmeatgoat" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Evaluating meat goat breeding stock</span></a></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/merinosheep" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Merino: King of Sheep</span></a></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/breedingewelambs" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">To breed or not to breed: breeding ewe lambs and doelings</span></a></span></span></span></p>
