<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.3em;"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/ethniccalendar" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Ethnic Holiday Calendar</span></a></span></span><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text"> | </span><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/_files/ugd/aded98_664f3229fbb64cd6966442d133a6ea2b.pdf" target="_blank" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">PDF</span></a></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/onfarmslaughter" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">In defense of on-farm slaughter: legalities and discussion</span></a></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/claims" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Marketing claims for sheep and goat products</span></a></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/ethnicmarket" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Producing and selling sheep and goats to the ethnic markets</span></a></span></span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/pelts" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Sheep Pelts:&nbsp; Asset or Liability?</a></span></span></span></p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.3em;"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/tariffs" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Tariffs:&nbsp; Good or Bad?&nbsp;</a></span> &nbsp;<span style="color:#CB0C0C;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">--NEW--</span><br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<span style="text-decoration:underline;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.sheepandgoat.com/tipsauction" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Tips for selling sheep and goats through public livestock auctions</span></a></span></span><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text"> </span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-ln8wnv0o" tabindex="-1" class="Oqnisf comp-ln8wnv0o wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-ln8wnv0o" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-ln8wnv0o" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-ln8wnv0o" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-ln8wnv0o" class="VgO9Yg"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-ln8wnv0oinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-ln8wnv0oinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="i8tgoc21" class="MMl86N zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx i8tgoc21 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h6 class="font_6 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:24px; line-height:1.3em;"><span style="font-size:24px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:basic,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="color_2 wixui-rich-text__text">Western Maryland Pasture-Based Meat Goat Performance Test</span></span></span></span></h6>
